it's probably one of the best lores about Robinhood

• Robinhood was the leader of the 'Merry Men' band 

• 'Merry Men' operated from Sherwood: Robinhood acquired 'Sherwood News' in 2024

• Robinhood traders are called 'Merry Men' in news &lt;Dentons, 2025&gt; &lt;BetterInvesting&gt; &lt;telegraph&gt;

• Interview with CEO Vlad Tenev in 2024, he references the legend: “Robin Hood himself grew up in the forest that sort of assembled his team of merry men out there.” He uses it as a metaphor for Robinhood the company’s journey from disruptive startup to established player &lt;Fast Company, 2024&gt; 

• Fortune describes Vlad and Baiju as MERRY MEN: Cofounders Vlad Tenev (left) and Baiju Bhatt have turned Robinhood into a hit and become billionaires on paper &lt;Fortune&gt;
